Tidbits Live gets a big upgrade.

• Build a night once and take it anywhere — events save as a single file with their pictures and clips inside.

• Bring a quiz you already have: import from Kahoot, CSV, GIFT, Aiken or SpeedQuizzing — and export back out.

• The host cockpit and event builder are redesigned, and every command has a menu item and a shortcut.

• Switch off anything you don't want on the big screen.

• Joining a game is one obvious button.
